                    <characteristic name="Special rules" typeId="8c35-8c96-b5da-3d94">Cthonic Shot: + [TRANSCENDENT] Potency when firing at a target within 4”.
Reliable: When making an attack with this weapon, you may reroll each failed attack die once. Dice rerolled in this way cannot be rerolled again.</characteristic>
                  </characteristics>
                </profile>
              </profiles>
