                    <characteristic name="Special rules" typeId="8c35-8c96-b5da-3d94">Sacrificial: Before attacking, a friendly MORTAL (including this one) within 3” of the target may lose 1 Vitality to grant +2 Velocity to the attack.
Commanding: If the Target of this attack is SURROUNDED! This weapon gains + [MORTAL] POTENCY.</characteristic>
